{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist Now!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add the game to your wishlist and wait for the grand opening (release)!</strong><br>By wishlisting it, you\u2019ll receive a notification on release day so you won\u2019t miss it.<br>Your wishlist support means the world to me and helps keep this project moving forward!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cAre you really okay with living like this?\u201d\u00a0</strong>For you, who are just getting through each day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a visual novel with simulation elements, depicting the stories of real-life travelers including Rieko Ayumi, who has traveled to 98 countries with <strong>80% of the content based on true events</strong>.<br>As a staff member at a bar where travelers gather in Tokyo, you will encounter their unconventional lives and grow alongside them. <br>In the process, your rigid values and assumptions are bound to be shaken.<br>This is a simulation for lost souls like you to encounter a <strong>new version of yourself</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real-Life Japanese Travelers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/43c8ac023fc9d16ea54c4ff09844f00e.poster.avif?t=1773659007\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/43c8ac023fc9d16ea54c4ff09844f00e.webm?t=1773659007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/43c8ac023fc9d16ea54c4ff09844f00e.mp4?t=1773659007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rieko Ayumi </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u201cAnything short of death is just a scratch.\u201d</i>A tough and fearless woman who has traveled to 98 countries.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strangled by a robber in Argentina, invited to become a fifth wife in Dubai, and crossing a river full of crocodiles on foot\u2026<br>These unbelievable yet <strong>true stories</strong> of survival will shatter the values of anyone weighed down by doubt and anxiety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/d533e9d66a031f35747621556fb9ca23.poster.avif?t=1773659007\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/d533e9d66a031f35747621556fb9ca23.webm?t=1773659007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/d533e9d66a031f35747621556fb9ca23.mp4?t=1773659007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kenty</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u201cBecause I\u2019m anxious, I keep moving.\u201d</i> A refreshingly timid nomadic worker.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded while hitchhiking in France, caught in a lockdown right after starting a job in the Philippines, and returning home after just six months, terrified by gunshots\u2026<br>His seemingly glamorous yet painfully messy career journey will gently\u2014but firmly\u2014push forward those who can\u2019t see their future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/3a864163f9641a93cf96b3bf11b27c30.poster.avif?t=1773659007\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/3a864163f9641a93cf96b3bf11b27c30.webm?t=1773659007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/3a864163f9641a93cf96b3bf11b27c30.mp4?t=1773659007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bell</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u201cIt\u2019s okay to run away. Life should be freer.\u201d</i></strong> <strong>An indie game developer and world traveler.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After leaving a major game company, going independent, and failing, she faced the fear of being taken to a stranger\u2019s home in Europe<br>and even underwent cosmetic surgery to overcome her own complexes.<br>Her brutally honest confessions, delivered with a laugh and the words \u201cBeing an adult is actually amazing,\u201d will completely dismantle the rigid \u201ccommon sense\u201d that binds you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/f4b347b46ba2875b8925b2c6a797d8e2.poster.avif?t=1773659007\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/f4b347b46ba2875b8925b2c6a797d8e2.webm?t=1773659007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/f4b347b46ba2875b8925b2c6a797d8e2.mp4?t=1773659007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get Closer and Draw Out Their True Feelings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, conversations may be nothing more than casual small talk.<br>But as your bond deepens, you\u2019ll unlock stories told nowhere else.<br>Near-death experiences of a world traveler, and the dark, unspoken truths of a former engineer listen closely to real-life philosophies that no textbook could ever teach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/30634341e25f2f14854fa1a570165d0e.poster.avif?t=1773659007\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/30634341e25f2f14854fa1a570165d0e.webm?t=1773659007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/590d1ce76993417c73017222465d9058.poster.avif?t=1773659007\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/590d1ce76993417c73017222465d9058.webm?t=1773659007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/590d1ce76993417c73017222465d9058.mp4?t=1773659007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Choices Shape the Face of the Bar</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experiences you gain through conversations with travelers, combined with the parameters you develop, will change the design of the bar\u2019s signboard.<br>Your growth and outlook on life are visualized directly through the face of the shop itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/ceb4fd862e76d2182e759fdefa277917.poster.avif?t=1773659007\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/ceb4fd862e76d2182e759fdefa277917.webm?t=1773659007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/e07d4480f8232769b6d9905147dc0b7e.poster.avif?t=1773659007\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/e07d4480f8232769b6d9905147dc0b7e.webm?t=1773659007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Background Gallery of 120 Scenes from Around the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story progresses, backgrounds of famous landmarks and hidden alleys from all over the world\u2014shared by the travelers\u2014will be unlocked.<br>Approximately <strong>70% of the backgrounds</strong> in this game were created using AI image generation.<br>120 unique types of scenery, crafted through both AI and human creativity, will bring color to your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bAI-generated images are marked with identification tags in the gallery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/8c7350d200baf13f3512eaed87c4fb5a.poster.avif?t=1773659007\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/8c7350d200baf13f3512eaed87c4fb5a.webm?t=1773659007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect Values in the \u201cLearning Notes\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist records impactful stories and lessons learned from the travelers in a notebook.<br>\u201cIt\u2019s okay to run away.\u201d<br>\u201cLanguage barriers can be overcome with gestures.\u201d<br>As these notes accumulate, they will become guiding principles for the lost protagonist\u2014<strong>and for you</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A developer\u2019s motivation truly depends on your click.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Working on a game alone can be tough at times\u2026<br>But every wishlist notification gives me the strength to keep going another day with a fresh cup of coffee.<br>I\u2019d love for you to become a companion on my journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Streaming &amp; Video Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to post gameplay videos and livestreams.<br>\u00a0I kindly ask that you include the following:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A link to the Steam store page</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Official hashtags: <strong>#\u65c5\u4eba\u7269\u8a9e #TravelerStories</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3975150?t=1773659007","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3975150?t=1773659007","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/432a2992d028125810de04e77b029a850af529a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773659007","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/432a2992d028125810de04e77b029a850af529a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773659007","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The character talks about their experience of being involved in a violent crime."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist Now!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add the game to your wishlist and wait for the grand opening (release)!</strong><br>By wishlisting it, you\u2019ll receive a notification on release day so you won\u2019t miss it.<br>Your wishlist support means the world to me and helps keep this project moving forward!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cAre you really okay with living like this?\u201d\u00a0</strong>For you, who are just getting through each day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a visual novel with simulation elements, depicting the stories of real-life travelers including Rieko Ayumi, who has traveled to 98 countries with <strong>80% of the content based on true events</strong>.<br>As a staff member at a bar where travelers gather in Tokyo, you will encounter their unconventional lives and grow alongside them. <br>In the process, your rigid values and assumptions are bound to be shaken.<br>This is a simulation for lost souls like you to encounter a <strong>new version of yourself</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real-Life Japanese Travelers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/43c8ac023fc9d16ea54c4ff09844f00e.poster.avif?t=1773659007\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/43c8ac023fc9d16ea54c4ff09844f00e.webm?t=1773659007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta