</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, conversations may be nothing more than casual small talk.<br>But as your bond deepens, you\u2019ll unlock stories told nowhere else.<br>Near-death experiences of a world traveler, and the dark, unspoken truths of a former engineer listen closely to real-life philosophies that no textbook could ever teach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/30634341e25f2f14854fa1a570165d0e.poster.avif?t=1773659007\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/30634341e25f2f14854fa1a570165d0e.webm?t=1773659007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/590d1ce76993417c73017222465d9058.poster.avif?t=1773659007\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/590d1ce76993417c73017222465d9058.webm?t=1773659007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/590d1ce76993417c73017222465d9058.mp4?t=1773659007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Choices Shape the Face of the Bar</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experiences you gain through conversations with travelers, combined with the parameters you develop, will change the design of the bar\u2019s signboard.<br>Your growth and outlook on life are visualized directly through the face of the shop itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/ceb4fd862e76d2182e759fdefa277917.poster.avif?t=1773659007\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/ceb4fd862e76d2182e759fdefa277917.webm?t=1773659007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/e07d4480f8232769b6d9905147dc0b7e.poster.avif?t=1773659007\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/e07d4480f8232769b6d9905147dc0b7e.webm?t=1773659007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Background Gallery of 120 Scenes from Around the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story progresses, backgrounds of famous landmarks and hidden alleys from all over the world\u2014shared by the travelers\u2014will be unlocked.<br>Approximately <strong>70% of the backgrounds</strong> in this game were created using AI image generation.<br>120 unique types of scenery, crafted through both AI and human creativity, will bring color to your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bAI-generated images are marked with identification tags in the gallery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/8c7350d200baf13f3512eaed87c4fb5a.poster.avif?t=1773659007\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/extras/8c7350d200baf13f3512eaed87c4fb5a.webm?t=1773659007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect Values in the \u201cLearning Notes\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist records impactful stories and lessons learned from the travelers in a notebook.<br>\u201cIt\u2019s okay to run away.\u201d<br>\u201cLanguage barriers can be overcome with gestures.\u201d<br>As these notes accumulate, they will become guiding principles for the lost protagonist\u2014<strong>and for you</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A developer\u2019s motivation truly depends on your click.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Working on a game alone can be tough at times\u2026<br>But every wishlist notification gives me the strength to keep going another day with a fresh cup of coffee.<br>I\u2019d love for you to become a companion on my journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Streaming &amp; Video Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to post gameplay videos and livestreams.<br>\u00a0I kindly ask that you include the following:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A link to the Steam store page</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Official hashtags: <strong>#\u65c5\u4eba\u7269\u8a9e #TravelerStories</strong></p></li></ul>","developers":["Karin Bell"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975150/c67a31c85ab7f30c29a8037247eeff43ddfa7b34/header.jpg?t=1773659007","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},